# .worktreeinclude: gitignored files to COPY into each new git worktree
# (claude --worktree, the EnterWorktree tool, subagents with isolation: worktree, desktop parallel sessions).
# Uses .gitignore syntax. A file is copied only if it matches here AND is gitignored, so tracked files are never duplicated.
# Docs: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees#copy-gitignored-files-into-worktrees

